  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FN-sambandet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to the United Nations Association of Norway. Its purpose is to inform schools and media about UN activities. It focuses on the Sustainable Development Goals, with emphasis on human rights, peace and disarmament, development, climate change and environment.</narrative>
  </description>
